01:51:44.230 --> 01:51:48.900
The point of this treaty, and I've reiterated this on a number of occasions, is that in

01:51:48.900 --> 01:51:55.700
every true sense, we force ourselves gradually to step away from an offensive posture.

01:51:55.700 --> 01:52:00.000
We gradually move away from that moment of madness.

